Encoder: Google/TensorFlow YAMNet classification-tflite v1, Apache-2.0; see LICENSE and NOTICE.

Only the output vector is extended to expose the existing 1024-value embedding. Weights/operators are unchanged.

Head: 2048 mean/std pooled features, regularized linear classifier, source-group cross-validation using development data only.

No source audio or transcripts are included in the main phone/watch APKs. No user audio was used for fitting.

